{"b":"Ps","c":111,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Praise ye the LORD. I will praise the LORD with my whole heart, in the assembly of the upright, and in the congregation.","it":[[48,50],[100,102]],"x":[["Ps.138.1",11,"e"],["Ps.149.1",9,"e"],["Ps.109.30",8,"w"],["Ps.106.1",8,"w"],["Ps.89.5",7,"e"],["Ps.35.18",7,"w"],["Ps.40.9",7,"w"],["Ps.40.10",7,"w"],["Ps.108.3",7,"w"],["Ps.22.25",6,"w"]]},{"n":2,"t":"The works of the LORD are great, sought out of all them that have pleasure therein.","it":[[22,25]],"x":[["Ps.104.24",12,"w"],["Prov.24.14",10,"r"],["Ps.139.14",8,"w"],["Ps.143.5",8,"w"],["Jer.32.17",5,"r"],["Jer.32.19",5,"r"],["Rev.15.3",5,"w"],["Eph.1.19",5,"r"],["Eccl.3.11",4,"r"],["Prov.17.16",4,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"His work is honourable and glorious: and his righteousness endureth for ever.","it":[[9,11]],"x":[["Ps.145.4",6,"r"],["Ps.145.5",6,"w"],["Rev.5.12",5,"r"],["Rev.5.14",5,"r"],["Ps.145.10",5,"r"],["Ps.145.12",5,"w"],["Ps.119.142",4,"w"],["Eph.3.10",4,"r"],["Exod.15.11",3,"w"],["Ps.103.17",3,"w"]]},{"n":4,"t":"He hath made his wonderful works to be remembered: the LORD is gracious and full of compassion.","it":[[60,62]],"x":[["Ps.103.8",6,"w"],["Ps.86.5",6,"r"],["Isa.63.7",6,"r"],["Ps.145.8",5,"e"],["Eph.1.6",5,"r"],["Eph.1.8",5,"r"],["Deut.31.19",4,"r"],["Deut.31.30",4,"r"],["Ps.78.38",4,"w"],["Rom.5.20",4,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"He hath given meat unto them that fear him: he will ever be mindful of his covenant.","x":[["Ps.105.8",6,"w"],["Luke.1.72",3,"w"],["Matt.6.26",3,"r"],["Matt.6.33",3,"r"],["Dan.9.4",3,"w"],["Luke.12.30",2,"r"],["Ps.34.9",2,"w"],["Ps.34.10",2,"r"],["Ps.89.34",2,"w"],["Ps.106.45",2,"w"]]},{"n":6,"t":"He hath shewed his people the power of his works, that he may give them the heritage of the heathen.","x":[["Ps.80.8",8,"w"],["Ps.2.8",8,"w"],["Ps.44.2",7,"w"],["Ps.78.12",6,"r"],["Ps.78.72",6,"r"],["Josh.3.14",6,"r"],["Josh.3.17",6,"r"],["Josh.6.20",6,"r"],["Josh.10.13",6,"r"],["Josh.10.14",6,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"The works of his hands are verity and judgment; all his commandments are sure.","it":[[23,26],[69,72]],"x":[["Ps.19.7",9,"w"],["Ps.89.14",6,"w"],["Deut.32.4",3,"w"],["Ps.98.3",3,"r"],["Ps.105.8",3,"r"],["Ps.119.151",3,"w"],["Ps.119.160",3,"r"],["Ps.119.86",2,"w"],["Ps.85.10",2,"r"],["Ps.93.5",2,"w"]]},{"n":8,"t":"They stand fast for ever and ever, and are done in truth and uprightness.","it":[[35,42]],"x":[["Matt.5.18",6,"r"],["Ps.19.9",5,"r"],["Rev.15.3",3,"r"],["Isa.40.8",3,"w"],["Rom.7.12",3,"r"],["Ps.119.127",2,"r"],["Ps.119.128",2,"r"],["Rom.3.31",2,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"He sent redemption unto his people: he hath commanded his covenant for ever: holy and reverend is his name.","it":[[95,97]],"x":[["Ps.99.3",10,"r"],["Luke.1.49",9,"r"],["Titus.2.14",9,"r"],["Luke.1.68",9,"r"],["Eph.1.14",6,"w"],["Rev.5.9",6,"r"],["Rev.4.8",5,"r"],["Heb.13.20",5,"w"],["Eph.1.7",5,"w"],["Heb.9.12",5,"w"]]},{"n":10,"t":"The fear of the LORD is the beginning of wisdom: a good understanding have all they that do his commandments: his praise endureth for ever.","it":[[21,23],[92,109]],"x":[["Prov.1.7",25,"e"],["Prov.9.10",23,"q"],["Job.28.28",21,"e"],["Eccl.12.13",16,"w"],["Matt.25.21",8,"r"],["John.5.44",8,"r"],["Matt.25.23",8,"r"],["Deut.4.6",7,"w"],["Prov.3.4",6,"w"],["Rom.2.7",6,"r"]]}]}